# Snapy Forge v2.3

Stable Android APK release.

## Highlights

- Dark neon Snapy Forge UI
- Full-screen animated landing page
- Batch video frame export
- Auto 8K Safe extraction mode
- PNG and JPEG export
- Output folder picker
- Face Match mode
- Friendly in-app error alerts
- Centered animated loading overlay
- Easter eggs:
  - Tap "Built by Aravind Shivaa" to open LinkedIn
  - Snow theme in December and January
  - Triple tap main page logo to return to landing

## APK

`Snapy-Forge-easter-stable.apk`

## Known Limitations

- Very large 8K videos depend on phone RAM and hardware codec support.
- Face Match is local and lightweight. For identity-grade matching, a dedicated ML model would be needed in a future release.

